DTSTAMP:20260813T000000Z
DTSTART:20260813T230000
DTEND:20260814T010000
SUMMARY:Perseid Meteor Shower: NEW MOON Peak Year
DESCRIPTION:The Perseids peak on a new moon this year\, so dark skies coul
 d hit roughly 60-90 meteors per hour. No telescope is needed. Bring blank
 ets to the yard and let the astronomy fan run the count. EAAA's Big Lagoo
 n gaze on 8/8 is the warm-up.\nPrice: Free\nArea: Pensacola Beach & Perdi
 do\nTimes: Peak nights Aug 11-12 + 12-13 · best 11 PM to dawn\nhttps://g
 rayhicks.github.io/coast-guide/events/ev-perseids.html
LOCATION:Your backyard (north sky)\, or Big Lagoon State Park for dark sky
 \, 12301 Gulf Beach Hwy\, Pensacola\, FL 32507
URL:https://grayhicks.github.io/coast-guide/events/ev-perseids.html
END:VEVENT
